msgstr "有关 DroneCAN ESC 的信息，请参见 :ref:`common-uavcan-escs`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:70
#: 16be258bff16479a846c144af824bc0e 68a5e5aa19384db6bcd470b3993122d8
#: b62e64a8a1674d739c48be953037f143 be8dbb701f97497ca2a198c8894d84c3
#: e3d670769f3c433798b68af7454d333a
msgid ""
"Each DroneCAN ESC or Servo will have an programmed ID or channel address "
"corresponding to the autopilot's servo/motor output channel. These are set "
"by switches on the ESC or via a setup/configuration program, depending on "
"the ESC."
msgstr ""
"每个 DroneCAN ESC 或舵机都有一个编程 ID 或通道地址，对应飞控的舵机/电机输出通道。这些 ID 通过 ESC "
"上的拨码开关或设置/配置程序来设置，具体取决于 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:72
