"There are three parameters that determine which autopilot servo/motor "
"channels are sent to the CAN ESC and/or Servos: For the examples below, the "
"values are shown for CAN driver #1."
msgstr "有三个参数决定哪些飞控舵机/电机通道被发送到 CAN ESC 和/或舵机：以下示例的值适用于 CAN 驱动 #1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:75
#: 5d03928555b841c79dd7c4e46ff5a1a9 6a09ab0089514c5a84e6d79ffc2fa46b
#: 7e98e7970c08433f8b355280c75c01dc 8390c5913c124c2e964cf044317ca0b4
#: f83896a26b0d4229bf9a5dc68355412f
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_NODE<CAN_D1_UC_NODE>` - which is the node ID of the "
"autopilot sending the commands to the ESCs so that there can be "
"differentiation between multiple sources on the CAN bus"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_NODE<CAN_D1_UC_NODE>` - 这是飞控发送命令给 ESC 的节点 ID，用于区分 CAN "
"总线上的多个来源"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:76
#: 49e357991c7741a8924ed7f20f481ce1 4a182238bb1d435fb4d8f8f6af6f977b
#: 7a6404b4c973464badab7eb457970ea7 e0d6a54d924a4642a36f29d7dc551c68
#: ea0b42e0b3a8476e8921db1b7e8e84fb
