":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>` - bitmask that determines which "
"autopilot servo/motor output signals are sent to the Servos on DroneCAN "
"Servos"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>` - 位掩码，决定哪些飞控舵机/电机输出信号被发送到 DroneCAN"
" 舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:79
#: 02f335a5146c4fbdb601789fc7ffb39e 26ac683cf4004325909ebe3c09f9ae56
#: 4f702344c339483ba600c2a8c381d25a 82e9ad8cd4d9419195801c9c4fd5580b
#: 8a3a923a239145f68c230f1a0543d2d3
msgid ""
"In the bitmap masks, each bit position represents an ESC or servo ID number "
"that the corresponding autopilot servo/motor channel command will be "
"directed to. For example, 00001111 (15 decimal) would send commands to ESC "
"or SERVO IDs 0 through 3."
msgstr ""
"在位掩码中，每个位位置代表一个 ESC 或舵机 ID 编号，对应飞控舵机/电机通道命令将被发送到该目标。例如，00001111（十进制 "
"15）将命令发送到 ESC 或舵机 ID 0 至 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:82
#: 23e986e29094433eb7a16393108edd1e 63624c98532141859fd5f28c010b4c87
#: 78f9b37f81c54e07998b8f8a338ea851 c396d72431064c1f99a867617ee9fef8
#: f23a3f825d9644eb93d0db976287f61f
msgid ""
"When using DroneCAN ESCs/Servos, you can set the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` for "
"those, but still use those outputs on the autopilot for GPIOs using the "
":ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` parameter. The autopilot outputs "
"will become GPIOS and the corresponding ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` will be sent out"
" DroneCAN."
msgstr ""
"使用 DroneCAN ESC/舵机时，您可以为其设置 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION``，同时通过 "
":ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` 参数将飞控上的这些输出用作 GPIO。飞控输出将变为 GPIO，对应的 "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 将通过 DroneCAN 发送。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-setup-advanced.rst:84
#: 38887751d6de48d7bc2e955248e21a84 57fee8b918de4dbe84261e6c72058365
#: 8bdf62046d6b44a38d8aa19418ebd596 cb16a6723fd045fda81522a1906d2e55
#: efdba675b37a4211a3bb5c8e15fae901
msgid ""
"To reduce bandwidth, the :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` and "
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>` params should be set to enable "
"only the motor and servo channels you need CAN signals to be sent to. In "
"addition, the :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF>` parameter lets you "
"further maximize bandwidth by offsetting the ESC position to the first time "
"slots on the bus, eliminating empty time slots. For example, if the ESCs are"
" on outputs 5 to 8, an offset of 4 will transport them in the first 4 "
"timeslots which would otherwise be empty and consume bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"为降低带宽占用，应设置 :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` 和 "
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>` 参数，仅启用需要发送 CAN "
"信号的电机和舵机通道。此外，:ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF>` 参数允许通过将 ESC "
"位置偏移到总线上的第一个时隙来进一步最大化带宽，消除空时隙。例如，如果 ESC 在输出 5 至 8，偏移量为 4 将使其在原本为空的前 4 "
"个时隙中传输，从而节省带宽。"

